s/neovim/neovim/deployments","created_at":"2014-01-31T13:39:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T09:22:08Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:17:45Z","git_url":"git://github.com/neovim/neovim.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:neovim/neovim.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim","homepage":"https://neovim.io","size":355316,"stargazers_count":94890,"watchers_count":94890,"language":"Vim Script","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6465,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2020,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["api","c","lua","neovim","nvim","text-editor","vim"],"visibility":"public","forks":6465,"open_issues":2020,"watchers":94890,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I came across this reproducible crash while pasting some non-code text into a .c file. I've put a minimal version of the text that causes the crash in this issue. I was able to reproduce this with both the nightly build (v0.5.0-dev+1256-gd19348923) and the Debug build that I built.\r\n\r\nI hope I created this in the correct project as it involves neovim, nvim-treesitter, treesitter and tree-sitter-c.\r\n\r\n- `nvim --version`:\r\n```\r\n# ~/neovim/bin/nvim --version\r\nNVIM v0.5.0-dev+1256-gd19348923\r\nBuild type: Debug\r\nLuaJIT 2.1.0-beta3\r\nCompilation: /usr/bin/cc -g -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -Wno-unused-parameter -Wstrict-prototypes -std=gnu99 -Wshadow -Wconversion -Wmissing-prototypes -Wimplicit-fallthrough -Wvla -fstack-protector-strong -fno-common -fdiagnostics-color=auto -DINCLUDE_GENERATED_DECLARATIONS -D_GNU_SOURCE -DNVIM_MSGPACK_HAS_FLOAT32 -DNVIM_UNIBI_HAS_VAR_FROM -DMIN_LOG_LEVEL=1